v-tbpkCZCvuuSVeN9jmWCb67FuzFIolVFvvcp-DCEfRIWZ0wrkHpBhX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDBKAbXzbthhf-SLF0AFl6TYNbVJ_HOLLCZ1MuQiiO3KQ&oe=6A5CBA04"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Honey & Hives | Beekeeping Simulator", "keywords": ["Beekeeping", "Cozy", "Nature", "Relaxing", "Simulator"], "long_description": "# Immerse yourself in the gentle art of beekeeping.\n\nTend your bees, harvest honey, and craft new renovations in your cozy garden. Take a moment to relax, watch the bees forage for nectar, and lose yourself in this wholesome, calming VR beekeeping experience.\n\n{841912192343363}\n\n# Harvest your Honey\nSlice away the wax to reveal the beautiful honeycomb left below\n\n{1587120989136293}\n\n# Extracting\n\nCrank the handle and spin your frame to extract the honey\n\n{1508486917060533}\n\n\n# Bottle up the honey\n\nOne of the best parts of beekeeping. Collect the honey in the jars ready to sell.\n\n{828965129863365}\n\n# Sell to locals\n\nReap the rewards of your hard work and sell the honey to the local townsfolk. Locals request a variety of different honey flavours keeping you on your toes.\n\n\n{1178333771171380}\n\n# Renovate the Garden\n\nCraft new renovations to bring your garden to life.\n\n{1633074811400756}\n", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the gentle art of beekeeping. Tend your bees, harvest honey, and craft new renovations in your cozy garden. Take a moment to relax, watch the bees forage for nectar, and lose yourself in this wholesome, calming VR beekeeping experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hypertonicgames.com/honey-and-hives-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hypertonic Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://hypertonicgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "274332